WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.760
and welcome to Over Cursed.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.680
Now this game was made in just two days

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.540
for the Asylum Game Jam.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.960
The Asylum Game Jam is a horror-themed

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.840
game jam for making new and interesting fun games.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.320
And I do appreciate the Stranger Things style intro-

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.780
even though I don't think this game has anything to do with that.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.900
But it supposedly has stuff to do with the paranormal.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.380
Overcursed Inc., what can I do for you?

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.600
Finally! What kept you?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.820
There's some electromagnetic disturbance.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.280
Probably an evil spirit, please do something!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.460
Don't worry, I'll take care of it. I'm on the job!

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.880
Oh, hello! Awwww, hi Rocky!

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.720
I just stepped on you? Oh no, there you are.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.600
Okay, do I need anything from my car maybe?

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.100
HELLOO?

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:51.220
Don't mind me, just gonna barge into the house where you called me from.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.320
Okay.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.540
Oh, this was made in two days? This is actually pretty cool!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.060
Okaay.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.840
Alright, so there's something wrong with all the TV's in the house.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.260
Is that what I'm supposed to be gathering here?

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.740
Somewhere up here maybe?

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.400
Like this TV antenna?

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.580
Okay, slap that shit into shape and off we go!

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.500
Alright. TV's seem to be all in a 100% working order.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.820
Talking head, flapping his gums in the distance, that's great.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:21.880
Okay, Rocky.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.040
C'mon.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.540
*Mark cringes at the odd noise*

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:27.720
Stranger waves?

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.380
Ohhhh. Are we making the Stranger Things reference?

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.200
I do love Stranger Things.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.200
Oh hi, Rocky.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.560
Oh, okay.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.600
Are you going to follow m- oh, there we go.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.920
Okay, Rocky, there's no ghosts here, c'mon little boy!

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.760
C'mon... we got it.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:47.420
*car starts up*

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.640
That was fun.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.600
Ohh. Overcursed Inc., I'm at your home.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:54.340
Oh, thank God! Here is the charlatan!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.840
I beg your pardon?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.780
Oh, please, I don't believe in your tall stories.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:01.460
But my wife is verrryyy superstitious.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:05.360
Install your stupid detectors and go away.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:06.540
Click.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.440
Okay, paranormal detection. Plug the detectors to the wall outlets.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:12.500
Ohhkkayyyy.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:13.720
I think- oh.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.140
Sorry, don't mind if I throw all of my shit on your floor,

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.480
ya doubting doubter.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.220
Okay.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:21.700
Hello?

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:22.980
Hi-yah.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.260
Okay.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:25.080
Ohhhh.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:26.420
Hah!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.320
Oh- *confused Mark*

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.260
Okay! Well, that's doing its thing.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:32.620
Grreaaattt?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:33.740
I think?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.940
Okay. Hello.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:36.440
Hi.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:37.280
Oh.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.320
It's loOoOcked?!?

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.160
Why is it locked?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.340
Okay. Heh!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:48.240
Plug. Outlet. *poof* Whaaattt the heck happened there?!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:49.940
Okay.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.920
Well, I got some paranormal powers of my own.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:53.900
Key.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:56.360
Nothing else here.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.440
ALRIGHTY THEN, JUST GONNA BARGE FURTHER INTO YOUR HOME!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.100
Yeah, feel free not to thro- show me around!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.260
Don't throw me around either, but, you know...

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.700
I'm not picky.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.360
Okay, Rocky, you stay there!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.460
It's a dangerous place around here!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:11.960
Haaa!

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.480
Plug. Outlet?!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:16.460
*nervous Mark cringes*

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.660
Ohhhkkaayyy! *dat cringe face tho*

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.440
Ohhkkayy!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.260
Alrighty, then.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.540
Turn the electricity back.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.740
Is it back here?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.500
Hello!

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.260
Okay.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.540
And everything's perfectly normal again!

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.700
Well, that was easier than I thought it was.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.780
Okay, don't mind my dopey walk,

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.460
as I go back. C'mon Rocky!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.020
Don't go running off again!

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.020
C'mon!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.840
*car starts up again* C'mon boi!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:45.880
Aww, that's so cute.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.400
Overcursed Inc., what can I do for you?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.400
A... a BEAST lives in my house.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.500
Please kill this awful thing,

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.560
and find a way to remove the bad smells.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.160
Consider it DONE.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.560
Ohhkay. Aww, come along Rocky! *OML THE DOGGO*

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.180
Aw, you're so cute!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:06.420
Deodorant. Ooh. You ON to something? *machine wooshes*

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.700
Woah, alright then.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.180
That was easier than I thought it was.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:13.080
Don't mind me as I dope my way up the stairs.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.780
Woah, find another one?

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.360
*more machine wooshing* Shhhhhh.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.640
Alrrrighty then.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.020
There's a pantry there.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:21.980
Okay, goodbye.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.460
*Mark cringes* Hellooo.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.880
Was that the beast?

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.420
*woof* Was that the scurrying beast?

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.720
Ohhkay. *machine wooshes and Mark cringes*

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.440
Alrighty then.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.120
Okkay!

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:37.540
Goodbye!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.620
The fuck is going on here?

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:45.100
Why are there so many- why- if my job is to do paranormal investigation, why am I running around -

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.100
a house as a deodorizer?

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.460
That doesn't exactly make a lot of sense.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.320
Okay, so there was something in the- *Dat face tho*

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.000
So there's something definitely in the pantry.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.740
I got a bear trap with YOUR name on it!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:57.980
Huh?!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.160
Heaahhh!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:00.900
K. I'ma see YOU.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.140
I'll see you in- *crashing noise*

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.520
*more cringing*

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.760
Ohhhhhhh my GOD!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:10.980
Dead rat?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.620
Wait, it was just a rat?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.060
That was the beast?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.180
Man, I'm beginning to think this is all a sham!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.700
I AM a charlatan!

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.780
I'm charlatan that's making some kind of money here. *r u sure?*

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.880
Overcursed Inc., what's your problem?

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.500
Dot, dot, dot.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.840
Hellooo?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:33.680
Mysterious scriptures, bedroom, CLEAN IT.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.900
Ohkayyyyy?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.020
I'm on my way!

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:38.900
Okie dokie, then.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.360
Clean the marks on the wall in the bedroom.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:46.280
Ohhh. This one's got a Castlevania style feel to it.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.500
I don't think this is going to be a fun adventure.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.520
I got my cleaning- where you going Rocky?

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.720
Where you going bud?

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:53.220
Huh?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.440
Where you going boy?

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:54.940
Huh?

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:55.940
Where you going?

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:57.260
There something over here?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:57.780
Huh?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.080
*growls* Oh, no. The backdoor is locked.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.620
Well, that does not bode well for me.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.680
I guess I'm just going to live with that.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.200
Alright, Rocky. C'mon along.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:09.480
Or stay there. Fine.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:09.980
Okay.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.100
Uhh.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:17.120
Oh, yes, of course, the bedroom's all the way at the tipy-topy of the placey-wacey.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:17.860
Alright.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:18.860
Hello.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.680
Ooh. Good boy.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:29.360
No. *sprays blood-painted message* Go back to the car- you better not do nothing to my dog!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.980
*sneakiplier*

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.200
Better not do nothing to my dog.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.980
*creepy noises commence*

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.900
Hhhhiiiiii? Hello! Hi!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.160
Oh, door's locked.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.980
Oh, this is the game we're going to play here.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.860
*sneakiplier back*

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.480
Uh huh.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:53.800
Uh oh. Here we go.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.040
Ohh. *BEWARE HEADPHONE USERS*

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.080
*loud noises* OHHHH Hi! *high-pitched screaming*

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:58.880
Okay, then!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.420
Run away? But not without my cleaning spray!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.440
I've got to finish the job!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:08.440
Oh, jeez. That rocking chair sure is, uh, rockin'. *haha punny*

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.360
Wait.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.920
Do I go- *pause* I can't go out- oh, no, I can't go out there. *slowly realizing he's dead*

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:13.920
Okay.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:15.780
*crunching noise as the doggo is mutilated*

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:16.980
*cringing turns to pure shock and disgust*

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:18.500
(screaming) NOOOOOOOO!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:20.520
*depressing music* (liek if u cri evrytim)

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:22.620
NOOOOOOOOO! *mark slowly dying inside* (me too fam)

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.060
*through the sad music* What?! *RIP doggo*

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.580
Fucking bullshit!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.500
What the fuck?!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.520
Oh, that's bullshit, my dog!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:37.040
Why did you kill my dog?!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:44.220
Oh, you as- oh. *confused* Ohhhhhkkkkaaayyyy?

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.580
Oh, you fuckers gonna get it now. *demolish the doggo killers*

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.080
FUCK YOU!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.900
What are you even? What are you? Fuck you!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.480
Oh, man, why'd you kill my dog?!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.720
*raising pitch* Why did you kill my dog?!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.320
Oh, my poor pup!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.820
Oh, fuck you, fuck you, FUCK you.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.460
Let's see, who else wants some?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.100
Fuck you!

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:05.920
Alright.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:06.740
How 'bout you?

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.060
Oh, oh, but, wait, wat, FUCK you.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.300
Oh, wait ya, FUCK you double kill.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.780
Anybody else in here? Huh? Good boy? FUCK OFF!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.480
Killed my dog!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.400
Okay, what else do I need to do?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.460
Oh, no. I've got thirteen of fifteen.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.540
(sadly) Ohhhhh.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.940
Oh, NO! *OOOOOOOOHHHHNOOOOOO*

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:35.940
Go back to your car and enjoy your evening? I'm emotionally devastated!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.280
Those goddamn ghosts!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.300
The fucking ghosts!

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.620
*car starts nonchalantly*

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.780
Oh, and that's the end?!

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.200
Aww, man!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.420
What the fuuuckkk?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.800
You can't do that to me!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.180
My poor pup! *RIP :'(*

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.400
Ohhhhhh.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.540
Well, for a game that was made in TWO DAYS-

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.020
that was really good.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.760
It had spooks, it had character, it had world-building.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:13.140
It got me emotionally attached to a dog and then took the dog away from ME?

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.980
(sadly) You can't do that, I got to go hug Chica. *I NEEED CHICA TOO, THE PUPPER IS DED :'(*

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:21.720
But either way, that was Overcursed. That was pretty good for what they did in two days.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.320
That's actually not bad at all.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.500
Like, they could do a lot of stuff with this!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.460
They might be able to expand this. I don't know where and I don't know how-

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.100
but that was pretty good.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:35.140
So, I also wanted to mention before I go: the noon video today which is supposed to be the Monday vlog-

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:38.020
is going to be late, but for a good reason.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:44.820
Today, and this is a big surprise, it's been very hard to contain this until today, but today-

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:48.060
we are going to be picking up Bob and Wade-

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.260
from the airport for a week full of making awesome videos for you guys.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:57.620
And I'm just crazy excited to be able to see my friends again and it's been very hard to not tell-

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:02.800
you guys about it beforehand, but what I'm going to do is I'm going to be vlogging all-day long,

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:08.100
and then hopefully I'll have another vlog available later today, hopefully not too much later afternoon.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:13.280
You guys will see it soon, it's just going to be a little late and I wanted to let you guys know about that-

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:17.080
so you weren't shocked, and appalled when the video was not there.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:22.500
But either way, thank you guys so much for watching! Let me know what you thought of Overcursed and you can play it for yourself down through the link in the-

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:30.280
description below, and as always, I will see you in the next video. Buh-bye!

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:36.080
*outro* ((GOODBYE FRENS))

